Description: Otter programming language - otter-net release candidate
 otter-net is the native implementation of the Otter programming language,
 a language that reads like plain English: one self-contained otter command
 that runs Otter 1.0.1 programs with otterPS's output and error messages.
 .
 This is an unsigned release candidate, not an Otter release.
